		{"id":"legend_group","type":"group","x":-60,"y":-980,"width":1520,"height":180,"label":"LEGEND","color":"#FFFFFF"},
		{"id":"legend_text","type":"text","x":-20,"y":-950,"width":1460,"height":120,"text":"# Legend\nMain data path: **R703 → ESP32 firmware → attendance event → backend API → SQLite → dashboard**. Node colors: grey = documentation/navigation · amber = hardware (R703 UNVERIFIED — HARDWARE VERIFICATION REQUIRED, ADR-012) · green = ESP32 firmware · blue = backend/database/API · red = privacy/testing/deferred AI · teal = project/goals/handoff · yellow = delivery/git/CI. Arrows show real design or information flow; the R703 alert node (red) must be resolved (HW-00) before any wiring.","color":"#FFFFFF"},

